  "whatThisDoesNotDo": [
    "It is not a backup.  One copy on one internal disk in one machine is a single point of failure, named here rather than left to be assumed.",
    "No offsite or removable copy exists, and none is scheduled.",
    "Nothing re-reads these digests on a schedule, so silent bit rot between now and the next manual check would not be noticed.",
    "The archive is not encrypted and carries no access control beyond the read-only mode and the owning account.",
    "It says nothing about whether the image boots, serves, or is compatible with any host."
  ],
