    "The six GitHub artifacts, which are left to expire on their own date.",
    "The temporary download under the session scratchpad, left in place.",
    "Every sealed record of the attempt, byte-unchanged."
  ],
  "whyThisExists": "The production budget is spent, so these three files cannot be made again.  The GitHub artifacts that held them expire on 2026-09-04 and the download that verified them sat in a temporary directory the operating system may delete without warning.  A second copy now lives somewhere that survives a reboot."
